      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dowell%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The village once hosted a Russian Orthodox church east of the tracks on Vogel Avenue, a testament to its diverse immigrant roots.",
